WEBVTT

01:28.580 --> 01:32.450
Our Secret
EP13

01:36.120 --> 01:36.910
Ding Xian

01:38.470 --> 01:39.550
Why don't you

01:43.270 --> 01:44.680
study in Jiangling too?

02:02.080 --> 02:03.190
What have you dreamed about?

02:03.440 --> 02:04.400
You blushed.

02:05.040 --> 02:07.470
It's a sweet dream, huh?

02:08.680 --> 02:09.510
No.

02:11.070 --> 02:11.790
No?

02:12.630 --> 02:14.120
Tell me, what's it about?

02:16.790 --> 02:18.040
Nothing.

02:19.280 --> 02:20.320
Nothing?

02:23.070 --> 02:23.959
What?

02:25.430 --> 02:26.120
Ding Xian

02:28.790 --> 02:29.760
What's up?

02:30.920 --> 02:33.070
Don't talk to me in class.

02:35.280 --> 02:36.630
Your glasses fell off.

02:45.040 --> 02:45.760
Tell me,

02:45.760 --> 02:46.959
what was your dream?

02:46.959 --> 02:47.760
You were so happy.

02:47.790 --> 02:48.400
I didn't.

02:48.400 --> 02:48.959
Did you dream about things

02:48.959 --> 02:50.200
you wish you could have in real life?

02:50.200 --> 02:51.150
Stop it.

02:51.680 --> 02:52.350
You look guilty.

02:52.560 --> 02:53.070
No.

02:53.150 --> 02:53.709
You do.

02:53.709 --> 02:54.320
I don't.

02:56.200 --> 02:58.200
Why don't you get it?

02:59.150 --> 03:01.760
Cherish your high school years!

03:02.630 --> 03:03.920
After graduation,

03:04.320 --> 03:07.120
you two will be far apart from each other.

03:15.120 --> 03:16.320
Draw a guiding line,

03:16.710 --> 03:19.990
then the angle ACD will be...

03:33.320 --> 03:35.920
What's wrong? You've been weird all day.

03:36.760 --> 03:37.630
Nothing.

03:38.510 --> 03:39.560
I'm listening.

03:42.709 --> 03:43.840
Is there anything on my face?

03:44.870 --> 03:45.680
No.

03:47.680 --> 03:49.790
You haven't even looked at me these days.

03:50.590 --> 03:51.709
How did you know there's nothing?

03:59.400 --> 04:00.790
Are you gonna go on or not?

04:01.120 --> 04:03.120
If not, I'll go to bed.

04:05.960 --> 04:07.430
Forget the thing you keep from me,

04:08.480 --> 04:10.840
but my tutoring time is priceless.

04:12.280 --> 04:13.920
After I go to the contest in a few days,

04:14.120 --> 04:15.680
you won't be able to find me even you want.

04:15.990 --> 04:17.029
But you don't cherish this now.

04:24.560 --> 04:25.310
Siyue

04:25.630 --> 04:26.630
The power is off!

04:28.350 --> 04:29.070
I see!

04:30.880 --> 04:31.680
Wait a second,

04:32.470 --> 04:33.510
I'll have a look.

04:43.160 --> 04:44.840
Why is the power suddenly off?

04:55.030 --> 04:55.600
What's up?

04:56.560 --> 04:57.510
Are you afraid of the dark?

04:58.230 --> 04:59.350
No, I'm not.

05:13.030 --> 05:13.560
Here,

05:29.280 --> 05:30.600
now you're not scared, are you?

05:51.789 --> 05:53.470
I like this song, too.

06:09.720 --> 06:10.600
Zhou Siyue

06:14.510 --> 06:16.310
I also want to study in Jiangling.

06:41.600 --> 06:42.880
You're not allowed to go out today.

06:42.910 --> 06:43.840
I'm gonna break your legs!

06:43.840 --> 06:44.880
I'll leave even if you do!

06:45.230 --> 06:46.160
Go ahead!

06:46.789 --> 06:48.190
Leave? Try it!

06:48.600 --> 06:49.350
What should we do?

06:50.400 --> 06:51.510
How did you do your job?

06:51.720 --> 06:52.510
What can I do?

06:52.510 --> 06:53.750
Before I talked to him well,

06:53.750 --> 06:54.720
he was taken away by his dad.

06:54.720 --> 06:55.440
Look how you spoiled him!

06:55.440 --> 06:56.840
Then beat me!

06:56.840 --> 06:57.789
Stop talking!

06:58.280 --> 06:58.789
What' wrong?

06:58.789 --> 07:00.030
You're finally here, look.

07:01.630 --> 07:02.070
Siyue

07:02.750 --> 07:04.070
Jiang, Siyue is here.

07:04.350 --> 07:05.400
You two really are...

07:05.560 --> 07:06.720
What are you doing?

07:07.070 --> 07:07.910
Uncle, auntie!

07:08.000 --> 07:08.630
Siyue

07:09.750 --> 07:10.470
You've come just at the right moment.

07:11.790 --> 07:12.790
You two are best friends.

07:13.680 --> 07:15.720
Help him figure out gains and losses.

07:16.160 --> 07:17.630
Go to the college first,

07:17.750 --> 07:18.750
then think about other things.

07:19.190 --> 07:20.510
You may consider Siyue to be your son!

07:20.880 --> 07:22.190
He's such a good student!

07:22.230 --> 07:23.030
What did you say?

07:23.350 --> 07:24.190
One more word?

07:24.440 --> 07:25.000
Stop it!

07:25.350 --> 07:26.230
-Well.  -Uncle

07:26.720 --> 07:28.070
Let me talk to you.

07:32.510 --> 07:33.960
He's unreasonable!

07:34.510 --> 07:35.000
Yeah.

07:38.160 --> 07:39.960
Siyue, please talk to him.

07:40.350 --> 07:40.880
OK.

07:44.280 --> 07:44.910
Auntie

07:46.310 --> 07:48.070
I'll have a good talk with Jiang Chen.

07:48.190 --> 07:49.750
Right, go ahead.

07:50.070 --> 07:51.230
Don't be so stubborn.

07:58.560 --> 07:59.470
Come here.

08:03.840 --> 08:04.400
Buddy

08:05.840 --> 08:06.720
I owe you once.

08:09.310 --> 08:10.400
So it's okay?

08:10.790 --> 08:11.790
Let's go.

08:59.400 --> 09:00.110
Still awake?

09:02.870 --> 09:03.960
You scared me.

09:06.040 --> 09:06.960
I'm so hungry.

09:09.550 --> 09:10.840
With no slippers,

09:11.720 --> 09:12.670
you might catch a cold again.

09:12.670 --> 09:13.550
Put them on.

09:33.670 --> 09:34.550
That's mine.

09:43.070 --> 09:44.750
You look like a little old man now.

09:46.310 --> 09:47.400
Old man?

09:47.840 --> 09:48.990
You seem to be very experienced.

09:50.430 --> 09:53.400
No wonder you could convince Jiang Chen's dad.

09:54.310 --> 09:55.480
How did you make it?

09:58.750 --> 09:59.550
It's actually

10:00.280 --> 10:01.990
not a big deal.

10:02.920 --> 10:03.990
I said that

10:04.190 --> 10:06.800
the reason why Jiang Chen wants to be a soldier

10:07.510 --> 10:08.600
is that he wants to be a man

10:08.600 --> 10:09.960
as excellent as his dad.

10:11.670 --> 10:12.750
Awesome!

10:13.920 --> 10:15.190
You're good at talking.

10:20.070 --> 10:21.670
It must be tough to prepare for National Olympiads.

10:23.750 --> 10:24.630
Go for it!

10:26.670 --> 10:28.040
I almost forgot.

10:29.190 --> 10:30.800
I heard that your score of math

10:31.190 --> 10:32.550
was only 90-something this time.

10:33.510 --> 10:35.190
It's a tough situation, girl.

10:37.360 --> 10:38.310
It's past two o'clock.

10:38.310 --> 10:39.920
Can't you give me a break?

10:40.160 --> 10:41.110
I see you're not sleepy yet.

10:41.720 --> 10:43.550
Come on, tutoring begins.

10:46.110 --> 10:47.720
I'm sleepy, very much!

10:48.240 --> 10:50.240
Let me go, Mr. Zhou.

10:53.160 --> 10:54.800
Let's go get some drink later.

10:55.070 --> 10:56.750
I know a great milky tea shop,

10:56.750 --> 10:57.630
and it's very cheap.

10:57.800 --> 10:58.750
Okay, okay!

11:01.800 --> 11:02.670
Jiang Chen?

11:03.670 --> 11:05.550
Well, Keke, we'll go first.

11:08.110 --> 11:08.870
Why are you here?

11:09.990 --> 11:11.070
Waiting for you...

11:11.280 --> 11:12.070
Me?

11:13.870 --> 11:15.040
You wear so little.

11:21.310 --> 11:22.040
Tie it on the waist.

11:22.550 --> 11:24.480
No, it's naff.

11:24.480 --> 11:25.630
I have to go to the art class later.

11:25.990 --> 11:27.040
Just tie it on.

11:27.240 --> 11:27.920
What are you doing?

11:27.920 --> 11:28.960
It's cold.

11:34.040 --> 11:35.310
Stickybeak.

11:35.800 --> 11:37.310
Hop on, I'll take you there.

11:41.960 --> 11:42.720
Come on.

11:47.360 --> 11:47.870
Forget it.

11:50.800 --> 11:51.870
Getting a ride

11:53.160 --> 11:53.840
is not bad.

11:57.800 --> 11:58.600
Hold on tight.

12:05.110 --> 12:07.190
You've decided which college to go to, haven't you?

12:08.510 --> 12:09.800
Of course,

12:10.040 --> 12:11.990
the acting department of the Film Academy.

12:12.400 --> 12:13.600
If I fail this year,

12:13.600 --> 12:14.550
I'll try again next year,

12:14.920 --> 12:16.160
until I make it.

12:17.070 --> 12:18.360
I think we are similar

12:18.840 --> 12:20.240
since we won't stop until we achieve the goal.

12:21.160 --> 12:22.550
Who is similar to you?

12:22.960 --> 12:24.630
I have a bright future.

12:25.160 --> 12:26.720
I have one too, OK?

12:27.190 --> 12:28.920
I'm going to be a soldier.

12:29.160 --> 12:30.240
I'm so bright.

12:31.670 --> 12:34.240
Idiot, you are really going to be a soldier?

12:35.510 --> 12:37.870
If we are strong, our country will be strong.

12:38.310 --> 12:40.870
If we are intelligent, our county will be intelligent.

12:41.600 --> 12:42.280
What?

12:42.870 --> 12:43.750
I said,

12:44.720 --> 12:47.800
If we are strong, the country will be strong.

12:48.040 --> 12:50.920
If we are intelligent, the country will be intelligent.

13:03.550 --> 13:05.190
The minimum passing score is so high.

13:07.240 --> 13:09.280
You're going to the same university?

13:09.960 --> 13:11.280
I wish I could.

13:11.750 --> 13:14.510
But Huaqing University won't give me a chance.

13:17.280 --> 13:19.840
I would be happy if we'll be in the same city.

13:23.040 --> 13:24.070
You still have the chance

13:24.070 --> 13:25.430
to go to the same city.

13:25.750 --> 13:27.750
But me, not gonna happen.

13:29.480 --> 13:30.510
You mean

13:31.070 --> 13:32.040
we just break up, right?

13:33.310 --> 13:35.310
This is great news for me.

13:35.870 --> 13:37.630
Bye, I'm gonna be beautiful alone!

13:40.750 --> 13:41.280
By the way,

13:42.190 --> 13:43.190
this weekend,

13:43.750 --> 13:45.110
let's go and see Jiang Chen off.

13:45.510 --> 13:46.630
He's gonna leave.

13:47.670 --> 13:48.630
So soon?

14:01.430 --> 14:03.110
Thanks for watching a movie with me.

14:04.670 --> 14:05.670
Never mind.

14:08.070 --> 14:09.110
Suddenly I thought that

14:09.110 --> 14:10.800
I won't see you again soon.

14:11.750 --> 14:13.110
I feel as if something is missing.

14:13.720 --> 14:16.240
You can call me

14:16.480 --> 14:17.600
or write to me.

14:18.600 --> 14:21.160
You're good at writing, aren't you?

14:22.190 --> 14:23.800
Who said that?

14:23.990 --> 14:25.240
I didn't write that.

14:25.360 --> 14:26.670
Others helped me.

14:27.400 --> 14:28.190
Besides,

14:28.400 --> 14:29.800
why do I write to you?

14:30.480 --> 14:31.360
What a friend!

14:31.870 --> 14:33.600
We are friends?

14:36.840 --> 14:38.400
Well, it's only my own wishful thinking.

14:48.400 --> 14:49.630
It's yours from now on.

14:50.840 --> 14:51.840
What's this?

14:52.310 --> 14:53.430
A parting gift.

14:56.720 --> 14:58.360
I have nothing

15:00.510 --> 15:01.430
but this motorbike.

15:02.750 --> 15:04.550
So sudden.

15:10.070 --> 15:10.750
Take it.

15:19.360 --> 15:21.360
I'll keep it for you.

15:23.240 --> 15:24.070
Wait for your return.

15:27.840 --> 15:28.480
And,

15:31.400 --> 15:34.510
do your best in your test tomorrow.

15:35.240 --> 15:37.280
You will definitely get into your dreamed university.

15:39.400 --> 15:40.720
Of course, I will.

16:12.510 --> 16:14.190
It's not fun for me to play with you.

16:15.240 --> 16:15.840
You do it.

16:19.430 --> 16:20.040
Are you sure?

16:20.480 --> 16:21.240
Yeah.

16:22.160 --> 16:24.040
I think she and I are well-matched.

16:24.240 --> 16:24.960
No offense.

16:25.280 --> 16:26.480
Just give you a break.

16:27.430 --> 16:27.960
OK.

16:30.310 --> 16:30.800
Come on.

16:31.720 --> 16:33.190
Teach him a lesson.

16:42.360 --> 16:42.960
You're so...

16:43.800 --> 16:44.750
lucky.

16:50.670 --> 16:51.750
It's just a coincidence.

17:03.360 --> 17:04.920
Why did he do this?

17:05.880 --> 17:08.430
He thought that Little Monster is a soft touch,

17:08.959 --> 17:09.999
but

17:10.070 --> 17:11.150
he got a hard one.

17:19.999 --> 17:21.190
Aren't you leaving tonight?

17:21.360 --> 17:22.910
You still have time to play billiards here?

17:23.150 --> 17:25.120
I just want to have some fun

17:25.270 --> 17:27.239
before I go.

17:27.910 --> 17:29.430
Who knew I may lose so many times.

17:30.550 --> 17:32.030
You guys, come and eat first,

17:32.030 --> 17:33.310
or it'll be cold later.

17:33.720 --> 17:34.240
OK, one more round.

17:34.240 --> 17:34.880
Coming.

17:36.760 --> 17:37.670
Come on, Song.

17:37.760 --> 17:38.360
Come on.

17:41.760 --> 17:42.550
Little Monster

17:43.640 --> 17:45.120
You are so good at playing billiards.

17:47.240 --> 17:48.310
The master taught me.

17:53.030 --> 17:54.000
Well...

17:54.790 --> 17:57.150
keep in touch with me later.

18:02.430 --> 18:05.840
It's better to tell me something about Keke.

18:07.960 --> 18:10.390
It turns out that you have other things in mind,

18:10.390 --> 18:11.270
buddy.

18:11.960 --> 18:13.720
If she goes out with other guys,

18:13.720 --> 18:15.270
you must tell me.

18:15.520 --> 18:16.360
How can that be?

18:16.430 --> 18:18.150
That makes me betray my friend.

18:19.150 --> 18:20.360
Let's cooperate.

18:21.430 --> 18:24.000
I can betray my friend, too.

18:33.150 --> 18:35.240
Just kidding, not gonna happen.

18:35.880 --> 18:37.480
They're my buddies.

18:46.640 --> 18:47.910
That's Keke.

18:51.000 --> 18:53.270
Jiang Chen, why are you not in a hurry?

18:53.550 --> 18:54.760
Aren't you afraid that your dad scolds you?

18:55.310 --> 18:56.070
Wait,

18:56.390 --> 18:58.310
why are you riding Jiang Chen's motorbike?

19:02.000 --> 19:04.240
Don't you have a test?

19:05.030 --> 19:07.360
I got there early and finished it early.

19:07.840 --> 19:09.270
Did... did you do well?

19:09.600 --> 19:11.030
Why do you talk so much?

19:11.270 --> 19:13.270
I'm willing to give you a ride.

19:13.760 --> 19:14.640
Hop on quickly.

19:14.720 --> 19:16.070
Yeah, how can you let a pretty girl wait for you?

19:16.070 --> 19:16.600
Hurry up.

19:16.670 --> 19:17.480
OK, I...

19:17.910 --> 19:18.480
Wait,

19:23.550 --> 19:24.640
you forget your bag.

19:31.310 --> 19:31.960
Well,

19:32.640 --> 19:33.720
I'll go.

19:35.600 --> 19:36.150
I'll drive.

19:49.430 --> 19:50.360
Bye.

19:50.960 --> 19:51.720
Hurry up.

19:51.880 --> 19:52.760
Take care.

19:53.190 --> 19:54.190
Go, go.

20:07.520 --> 20:09.000
Stop looking. Let's go.

20:14.360 --> 20:17.120
We'll meet again someday.

20:21.480 --> 20:22.310
Let's go.

20:30.760 --> 20:31.720
Handsome, huh?

20:41.120 --> 20:42.000
Siyue

20:42.840 --> 20:44.790
The national contest is coming.

20:45.270 --> 20:46.070
Try your best.

20:46.720 --> 20:47.550
I believe that

20:47.840 --> 20:49.430
you definitely can get a place of Huaqing University.

20:50.150 --> 20:51.000
Huaqing University...

20:51.000 --> 20:51.520
OK.

20:52.390 --> 20:53.670
I also think that he will make it.

20:53.760 --> 20:54.760
Siyue can do it.

20:54.910 --> 20:56.000
He has such good grades.

20:56.120 --> 20:56.790
All right.

20:57.790 --> 20:59.360
Stop talking.

21:00.360 --> 21:01.840
The time you pay attention to others

21:01.840 --> 21:03.430
can be used in your study,

21:03.430 --> 21:04.430
okay?

21:24.150 --> 21:26.430
Do you know anything efficacious

21:26.520 --> 21:28.910
that can get one lucky?

21:31.430 --> 21:32.430
For Zhou Siyue?

21:33.760 --> 21:35.960
Keep your voice down. Don't let him hear us.

21:36.390 --> 21:37.600
I haven't seen you care so much

21:37.600 --> 21:39.030
when you have a test.

21:40.520 --> 21:41.520
That's different.

21:42.150 --> 21:45.240
It is of great importance to him.

21:46.070 --> 21:48.520
There are lucky pens being sold near our school.

21:48.520 --> 21:49.520
Why don't you buy him one?

21:51.120 --> 21:52.390
Nothing new.

21:52.960 --> 21:54.310
Lucky bookmark?

21:56.030 --> 21:57.030
Not good enough...

21:57.840 --> 21:58.430
Anything else?

21:58.480 --> 21:59.480
Well...

22:01.360 --> 22:02.880
if you're heartfelt,

22:03.190 --> 22:04.670
make him one by yourself.

22:23.070 --> 22:23.960
Ding Xian

22:25.000 --> 22:26.070
Wait... wait a second.

22:28.070 --> 22:28.790
OK.

22:32.240 --> 22:33.070
What are you doing?

22:33.910 --> 22:34.880
Reading.

22:35.430 --> 22:37.150
Didn't I teach you this one before?

22:37.240 --> 22:38.150
Why is it wrong again?

22:38.270 --> 22:38.910
Is it?

22:39.120 --> 22:40.190
Let me teach you one more time.

22:40.640 --> 22:42.120
That's OK. I'll figure it by myself.

22:42.270 --> 22:44.000
Go to bed, and you have a test tomorrow.

22:44.480 --> 22:45.640
Don't worry about me.

22:45.880 --> 22:46.550
Well, I...

22:47.270 --> 22:47.960
Good night.

22:48.030 --> 22:48.310
You...

22:48.310 --> 22:49.190
-Good luck on the test!  -I tell you...

23:14.760 --> 23:15.430
Oh, God.

23:18.670 --> 23:19.760
Zhou Siyue

23:23.840 --> 23:24.790
Zhou Siyue

23:31.550 --> 23:32.480
Why are you here?

23:33.600 --> 23:35.150
I was supposed to see you off,

23:35.550 --> 23:37.070
but I got up late.

23:39.190 --> 23:40.600
It's just a test.

23:40.960 --> 23:42.030
I'll be back after it.

23:42.480 --> 23:43.670
How could you say that?

23:44.030 --> 23:46.150
It's about your university.

23:55.030 --> 23:55.840
Are you...

23:57.270 --> 23:58.270
nervous?

24:02.600 --> 24:03.360
A bit.

24:07.600 --> 24:08.520
Give me your hand.

24:17.240 --> 24:18.910
Good luck.

24:23.030 --> 24:24.030
This is my first time doing this.

24:24.550 --> 24:25.720
I hope you don't mind it's ugly.

24:30.840 --> 24:33.190
So you didn't do your homework,

24:33.430 --> 24:34.910
and this is what you were doing.

24:36.150 --> 24:37.640
You almost caught me.

24:40.070 --> 24:41.270
Stupid...

24:46.790 --> 24:47.430
Come here.

24:59.840 --> 25:01.360
My hair isn't clean.

25:03.000 --> 25:05.520
That's fine. Absorb some anima.

25:10.840 --> 25:12.270
The final exam is coming.

25:12.670 --> 25:14.000
Go back and do your homework.

25:17.430 --> 25:18.840
When the next semester begins,

25:19.310 --> 25:20.600
I have a present for you.

25:27.600 --> 25:29.430
Ding Xian also came here to cheer for Siyue.

25:31.430 --> 25:32.600
Mr. Liu

25:33.360 --> 25:35.000
It's time to get in.

25:41.760 --> 25:43.550
Siyue

25:43.880 --> 25:44.960
Don't be nervous about the test.

25:46.310 --> 25:48.310
Just do what you usually do.

25:48.760 --> 25:50.150
You'll be fine.

25:56.880 --> 25:57.430
Don't worry.

25:58.550 --> 25:59.430
I'm ready.

26:01.790 --> 26:02.310
Go.

26:07.360 --> 26:08.150
Mr. Liu

26:10.270 --> 26:11.670
If I get admitted to Huaqing,

26:12.240 --> 26:13.310
could you do me a favor?

26:13.550 --> 26:15.880
Even ten is okay.

26:23.030 --> 26:23.880
Zhou Siyue

26:24.640 --> 26:25.760
You must pass the exam.

26:26.880 --> 26:28.430
The road ahead is so long.

26:29.030 --> 26:31.030
You're going to have a bright future.

26:31.670 --> 26:32.390
Come on.

27:21.760 --> 27:22.640
What are you doing?

27:24.310 --> 27:26.520
The winter holiday makes you distracted, right?

27:29.640 --> 27:32.120
Mr. Zhou, I'm so tired.

27:34.520 --> 27:35.880
You don't wanna study in Jiangling?

27:36.840 --> 27:37.520
Yeah.

27:38.910 --> 27:40.390
I'd better go to Hangzhou.

27:45.190 --> 27:45.910
Okay,

27:46.720 --> 27:48.310
it's none of my business anyway.

27:54.310 --> 27:55.480
How nice Hangzhou is,

27:55.550 --> 27:56.720
so is the scenery.

27:57.640 --> 27:58.880
And there isn't some guy

27:58.880 --> 28:00.190
tutoring me every day.

28:05.310 --> 28:06.070
What's wrong?

28:11.240 --> 28:12.600
I was kidding.

28:15.640 --> 28:16.360
What are you doing?

28:23.430 --> 28:24.240
Are you making fool of me?

28:25.120 --> 28:25.910
I'm not.

28:27.720 --> 28:28.550
Are you...

28:28.760 --> 28:32.000
Why do you poke me? You always do this.

28:32.070 --> 28:32.640
And you always hit me.

28:32.640 --> 28:34.520
Just tell me if you don't want to do your homework.

28:34.520 --> 28:35.790
I didn't.

28:35.790 --> 28:36.840
This is interesting, huh?

28:37.360 --> 28:38.430
I really didn't.

28:39.310 --> 28:39.790
Stop...

28:45.240 --> 28:46.190
Hello, mom.

28:51.430 --> 28:53.070
OK, I get it.

28:56.480 --> 28:57.150
What's wrong?

29:02.310 --> 29:04.910
Something happened to my family and I have to go back.

29:40.960 --> 29:41.640
Uncle Ding

29:46.190 --> 29:47.000
I'm sorry to hear that.

29:50.430 --> 29:51.240
Thanks.

30:07.070 --> 30:07.670
Xianxian

30:11.150 --> 30:11.910
Su

30:13.840 --> 30:14.910
I thought

30:15.360 --> 30:16.640
you won't be back at the Spring Festival.

30:18.550 --> 30:19.910
I will definitely come back to take a look

30:20.000 --> 30:21.240
after something like this.

30:22.190 --> 30:23.640
How are you?

30:31.360 --> 30:32.640
When I was a kid,

30:33.960 --> 30:35.600
I didn't know what parting is.

30:38.190 --> 30:39.760
When I grew up,

30:41.670 --> 30:44.790
I realized this is such a sad thing.

30:55.360 --> 30:56.150
Yeah.

30:58.190 --> 31:00.550
Growing up itself is a sad thing.

31:01.360 --> 31:03.240
Even the best friends

31:04.430 --> 31:06.310
will gradually become strangers.

31:08.910 --> 31:10.030
There's nothing we can do.

31:12.190 --> 31:13.550
Because everyone

31:14.840 --> 31:16.430
will have a new life of their own.

31:22.120 --> 31:23.760
Then I don't want to grow up.

31:27.120 --> 31:28.150
I still remember in those years

31:29.240 --> 31:31.000
the Keshan Brat

31:31.790 --> 31:32.910
cried three times a day.

31:33.430 --> 31:35.070
When I see you every day,

31:35.760 --> 31:37.390
you cried like a little dirty cat.

31:43.670 --> 31:44.480
Yeah.

31:46.070 --> 31:47.430
In middle school,

31:48.120 --> 31:50.030
those boys were always picking on me.

31:51.240 --> 31:52.240
Do you still remember?

31:52.840 --> 31:54.480
You gave me a bag of toffee,

31:55.240 --> 31:56.480
and they asked me for it.

31:57.640 --> 31:59.270
I didn't want them to find out,

32:00.000 --> 32:01.880
so I hid it under a tree.

32:03.270 --> 32:04.720
Then it rained.

32:05.360 --> 32:07.000
When I went back for it,

32:09.240 --> 32:10.790
there were only the wrappers.

32:13.790 --> 32:14.760
Tell me,

32:15.520 --> 32:17.550
if it's the more you cherish something,

32:18.670 --> 32:20.070
the more you can't keep it?

32:27.120 --> 32:27.720
Xianxian

32:30.030 --> 32:30.840
Here's something for you.

32:35.120 --> 32:37.480
It was for kids during the Spring Festival.

32:38.670 --> 32:39.240
Here.

32:44.310 --> 32:45.270
For me,

32:46.840 --> 32:48.720
you'll always be the same Xianxian.

32:57.670 --> 32:59.550
But I'm not a kid anymore.

33:08.000 --> 33:09.030
Zhou Zongtang

33:09.550 --> 33:11.190
Do you know it's the Spring Festival today?

33:11.520 --> 33:12.760
You still gonna go out?

33:13.150 --> 33:15.240
Yun, I really have something to do.

33:16.790 --> 33:17.910
It's still a school thing.

33:18.190 --> 33:19.760
You haven't been in class for so long.

33:20.030 --> 33:21.310
What things do you have?

33:21.880 --> 33:22.760
Besides,

33:23.070 --> 33:24.670
can it be more important
than the Spring Festival?

33:24.910 --> 33:26.270
Can you trust me?

33:26.310 --> 33:27.760
If you don't even believe me...

33:29.000 --> 33:30.070
I can't explain it clearly

33:30.070 --> 33:31.000
in several words.

33:31.640 --> 33:32.640
Zhou Zongtang

33:33.480 --> 33:35.000
If you leave this house today,

33:35.720 --> 33:37.030
we won't celebrate the Spring Festival!

33:59.790 --> 34:01.000
Aren't you going out?

34:17.390 --> 34:18.480
Take good care of you two.

34:36.519 --> 34:39.150
Xianxian, why are you here?

34:39.430 --> 34:41.280
Go back. It's cold outside.

34:43.000 --> 34:44.190
Dinner is ready.

34:48.320 --> 34:49.280
You eat first.

34:50.150 --> 34:52.280
Daddy wants to stay outside for a while.

35:00.280 --> 35:02.830
It's cold and cheerless this year.

35:05.040 --> 35:05.720
Yeah.

35:07.960 --> 35:09.430
During the Spring Festival before,

35:11.040 --> 35:13.040
your grandma was doing all the shopping

35:13.960 --> 35:15.150
and cooking.

35:17.870 --> 35:20.110
And then she'll gather

35:22.110 --> 35:23.390
the whole family together.

35:30.720 --> 35:31.430
Dad

35:32.760 --> 35:35.280
We can't change it,

35:36.910 --> 35:38.910
but to accept it.

35:54.390 --> 35:56.080
Let's go in.

36:16.800 --> 36:17.390
Are you there?

36:26.150 --> 36:26.870
Hello.

36:29.320 --> 36:30.430
How are

36:31.110 --> 36:32.240
your family members?

36:34.670 --> 36:35.830
They're fine.

36:49.350 --> 36:53.430
Happy new year, happy new year.

36:54.000 --> 36:58.000
Happy new year to you all.

36:58.960 --> 37:03.040
We're singing and dancing.

37:03.320 --> 37:07.080
Happy new year to you all.

37:10.560 --> 37:12.280
Do you feel better?

37:12.910 --> 37:14.110
What do you mean?

37:16.560 --> 37:18.080
You know I'm in a bad mood?

37:19.280 --> 37:21.760
Probably because we've been deskmates for a long time,

37:22.830 --> 37:24.280
even if I didn't see you,

37:25.240 --> 37:27.560
I can imagine your expression.

37:31.830 --> 37:33.320
How are you in your hometown?

37:35.590 --> 37:36.520
It's happy.

37:38.670 --> 37:40.830
There's a big dinner at home,

37:42.110 --> 37:43.240
and I was stuffed.

37:45.350 --> 37:45.830
How about you?

37:46.520 --> 37:47.480
I...

37:50.960 --> 37:52.520
I'm watching fireworks at home.

37:54.720 --> 37:57.720
We also had fireworks today.

38:04.350 --> 38:05.720
Do you feel it?

38:07.430 --> 38:09.430
How time flies.

38:10.760 --> 38:11.870
After the festival,

38:13.040 --> 38:15.080
we're gonna grow up.

38:18.480 --> 38:19.080
Yeah.

38:20.390 --> 38:21.520
But that's okay.

38:23.150 --> 38:24.280
We can watch the fireworks together

38:25.320 --> 38:27.190
next year.

38:27.910 --> 38:28.520
Great.

38:30.040 --> 38:31.350
We watch fireworks together next year.

38:34.320 --> 38:35.280
Happy New Year,

38:36.560 --> 38:37.320
Zhou Siyue

38:39.080 --> 38:39.960
Happy New Year,

38:41.190 --> 38:41.910
Ding Xian

39:02.830 --> 39:03.960
Before the class is over,

39:04.190 --> 39:05.720
I have a piece of news.

39:06.480 --> 39:08.590
Let's congratulate Zhou Siyue

39:09.040 --> 39:11.320
on passing the National Olympiads,

39:11.760 --> 39:13.080
and he's gonna be a student of

39:13.080 --> 39:14.760
Huaqing University!

39:17.430 --> 39:18.190
Awesome!

39:21.080 --> 39:23.000
Besides, those who didn't get recommended,

39:23.150 --> 39:24.110
don't give up.

39:25.000 --> 39:27.080
Where there is struggle, there is hope.

39:27.800 --> 39:30.080
Keep working hard in the new term,

39:30.280 --> 39:31.320
and make progress.

39:33.960 --> 39:35.430
OK, class is over.

39:36.870 --> 39:38.670
Siyue, you become a college student.

39:39.080 --> 39:40.390
Siyue, please tutor us

39:40.390 --> 39:41.910
if you're free.

39:42.190 --> 39:43.110
Siyue, me too.

39:43.590 --> 39:44.800
-OK.  -St... st...

39:45.080 --> 39:45.870
stop it.

39:46.000 --> 39:47.870
Everyone makes an appointment. Siyue is very busy now.

39:47.960 --> 39:48.630
If you have the intention,

39:48.630 --> 39:50.150
come to me to make an appointment first. Thank you.

39:50.190 --> 39:50.960
Just ignore him.

39:51.190 --> 39:52.430
Come on, come on, come on, come on.

39:54.670 --> 39:55.830
You're really everywhere.

40:01.870 --> 40:02.800
Ding Xian

40:05.960 --> 40:08.080
Pack up and move back.

40:10.190 --> 40:11.190
Move back.

40:13.720 --> 40:15.720
You're too blatant.

40:16.590 --> 40:19.350
I've got aunt's permission.

40:20.190 --> 40:21.430
I don't believe it.

40:23.320 --> 40:24.320
Move quickly.

40:24.720 --> 40:26.760
You'd better stop gossiping. With the time,

40:26.760 --> 40:28.390
you can figure out two more questions.

40:29.110 --> 40:29.960
Quickly.

41:04.800 --> 41:07.280
This is the gift you said?

41:13.870 --> 41:16.630
Why do you want me to move back?

41:22.800 --> 41:24.240
To make tutoring convenient.

41:25.670 --> 41:26.960
No more reasons.

41:30.040 --> 41:31.190
For tutoring...

41:31.800 --> 41:33.080
Are you stupid?

41:33.350 --> 41:34.350
You even believed it.

41:35.190 --> 41:37.350
Why do you always call me stupid?

41:42.760 --> 41:44.390
My whole high school

41:45.080 --> 41:46.720
started from being deskmate with you.

41:48.430 --> 41:50.190
At the end, of course,

41:50.830 --> 41:52.320
I have to be your deskmate.

41:54.080 --> 41:55.190
Otherwise,

41:59.080 --> 41:59.910
it'll be a pity.

42:24.520 --> 42:27.390
Thinking that you have entered Huaqing,

42:28.760 --> 42:31.000
but I was still wandering outside Jiangling.

42:32.960 --> 42:33.760
Deskmate

42:34.760 --> 42:35.830
You're so good at studying.

42:36.870 --> 42:38.350
Do you have

42:38.480 --> 42:41.080
any shortcuts to improve grades?

42:43.150 --> 42:45.150
You wanna play petty tricks?

42:50.190 --> 42:51.630
But I

42:52.000 --> 42:53.430
do have a way.

43:00.430 --> 43:02.670
I made this

43:02.670 --> 43:04.320
college entrance examination countdown schedule for you.

43:05.150 --> 43:06.560
So you had a plan long ago.

43:08.110 --> 43:10.080
Because you make me worry so much.

43:12.190 --> 43:13.240
Make you worry.

43:16.910 --> 43:17.590
Come on!

43:19.830 --> 43:21.350
I won't let you down!
